    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Shuyun Huazhang&quot; is a digital innovation design project of Sanxingdui Museum. It covers rich content: the digital scenes include innovative museums and fantastic Sanxingdui ruins; the digital characters are meticulous from the human body to accessories, materials, hair, etc.; the digital film and television include two-dimensional and three-dimensional, showing wonderful; digital interaction supports VR and Windows, with diverse experiences; VFX uses Naigara, Houdini, EmberGen and other technologies to create cool special effects, so that Sanxingdui culture blooms new charm in digitalization.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Shuyun Huazhang&quot; is a digital innovation design project of Sanxingdui Museum. It covers rich content: the digital scenes include innovative museums and fantastic Sanxingdui ruins; the digital characters are meticulous from the human body to accessories, materials, hair, etc.; the digital film and television include two-dimensional and three-dimensional, showing wonderful; digital interaction supports VR and Windows, with diverse experiences; VFX uses Naigara, Houdini, EmberGen and other technologies to create cool special effects, so that Sanxingdui culture blooms new charm in digitalization.</p>",
